OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA cloudy
OL,6,Fevening with showers or even some
OL,7,Flonger spells of rain, with some heavy
OL,8,Foutbreaks. Then turning clearer across
OL,9,FGlasgow and the south overnight while
OL,10,Fblustery showers continue over Argyll
OL,11,Fand Loch Lomond.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FRemaining windy and showery,
OL,14,Fthe showers heavy with the risk of the
OL,15,Fodd thunderstorm. A few drier and
OL,16,Fsunnier spells. Fresh to strong
OL,17,Fwesterly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
